<section id="keunggulan" class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 sm:mb-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Mengapa Pilih <span class="text-emerald-700">Rasi Dental Studio?</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 font-medium">
        Kombinasi kenyamanan studio estetik dengan penanganan medis dokter spesialis.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base">
          1
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Biaya Transparan 100%</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Estimasi biaya dijelaskan dari A sampai Z sebelum tindakan dimulai. Tanpa biaya pendaftaran atau tagihan tak terduga.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base">
          2
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Suasana Studio Café</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Ruang tunggu estetik ber-AC dengan musik santai. Bebas dari bau obat atau suasana rumah sakit yang menakutkan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center font-black text-base">
          3
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900">Spesialis Ortodonti</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Pemasangan behel langsung ditangani Dokter Spesialis Ortodonti (Sp.Ort) alumni Unpad berlisensi resmi.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


